+### Crawler subsystem (`crawler/`, Python)
+
+Read by the Python crawler process, not by Next.js. Flag-style variables accept `1`, `true`, `yes`, or `on`; anything else (including unset) is off.
+
+| Variable | Local boundary | Production boundary |
+|---|---|---|
