+ * credentials to a third party, `frame-ancestors 'none'` blocks clickjacking,
+ * and `default-src`/`connect-src 'self'` confine data exfiltration to our own
+ * origin. Introducing a nonce (which requires a proxy/middleware layer) is the
+ * follow-up that would let `'unsafe-inline'` be dropped.
